start:hostbased_auth_nonroot_ssh
description:after mkhostbased-auth, a user with no ssh keys logs in by ssh from the CN to the SN through host-based authentication alone. Root's private keys on the CN are moved aside for the login. A login before mkhostbased-auth must fail, so the second login can only come from the host-based setup
label:hostbased
os:Linux
cmd:/opt/xcat/share/xcat/tools/autotest/testcase/hostbased_auth/nonroot_ssh.sh setup xcathba $$CN $$SN
check:rc==0
check:output=~HBA-SETUP-OK
cmd:/opt/xcat/share/xcat/tools/autotest/testcase/hostbased_auth/nonroot_ssh.sh login xcathba $$CN $$SN
check:rc!=0
check:output=~HBA-LOGIN-BAD
cmd:mkhostbased-auth $$SN,$$CN
check:rc==0
cmd:/opt/xcat/share/xcat/tools/autotest/testcase/hostbased_auth/nonroot_ssh.sh login xcathba $$CN $$SN
check:rc==0
check:output=~HBA-LOGIN-OK
check:output!~HBA-LOGIN-BAD
cmd:/opt/xcat/share/xcat/tools/autotest/testcase/hostbased_auth/nonroot_ssh.sh cleanup xcathba $$CN $$SN
check:rc==0
check:output=~HBA-CLEANUP-OK
end

start:hostbased_auth_scope
description:mkhostbased-auth trusts only the nodes of its noderange. After mkhostbased-auth on the SN alone, the SN no longer trusts the CN, so the login from the CN to the SN fails. -r then removes the setup from both nodes
label:hostbased
os:Linux
cmd:/opt/xcat/share/xcat/tools/autotest/testcase/hostbased_auth/nonroot_ssh.sh setup xcathba $$CN $$SN
check:rc==0
check:output=~HBA-SETUP-OK
cmd:mkhostbased-auth $$SN,$$CN
check:rc==0
cmd:/opt/xcat/share/xcat/tools/autotest/testcase/hostbased_auth/nonroot_ssh.sh login xcathba $$CN $$SN
check:rc==0
check:output=~HBA-LOGIN-OK
cmd:mkhostbased-auth $$SN
check:rc==0
cmd:/opt/xcat/share/xcat/tools/autotest/testcase/hostbased_auth/nonroot_ssh.sh login xcathba $$CN $$SN
check:rc!=0
check:output=~HBA-LOGIN-BAD
cmd:mkhostbased-auth -r $$SN,$$CN
check:rc==0
cmd:lsdef $$CN -i postbootscripts
check:output!~confighostbasedauth
cmd:xdsh $$SN,$$CN "test -e /etc/ssh/shosts.equiv && echo HBA-FILE-LEFT || echo HBA-FILE-GONE"
check:output!~HBA-FILE-LEFT
cmd:/opt/xcat/share/xcat/tools/autotest/testcase/hostbased_auth/nonroot_ssh.sh cleanup xcathba $$CN $$SN
check:rc==0
check:output=~HBA-CLEANUP-OK
end
